<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy 19th Birthday ♡</title><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    background: #A8B5A0;
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    color: #52634D;
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow-x: hidden;
}

.container {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: auto;
    padding: 35px 20px;
    text-align: center;
}

.card {
    background: #F8F6ED;
    padding: 35px 22px;
    border-radius: 28px;
    margin-top: 30px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(50,70,45,0.15);
}

.top {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    color: #8B9A80;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.flower {
    font-size: 45px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

h1 {
    font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
    color: #65795E;
    font-size: 43px;
    line-height: 1.2;
}

.subtitle {
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-top: 15px;
    line-height: 2;
    color: #87917D;
}

.divider {
    color: #A8B5A0;
    margin: 22px 0;
    letter-spacing: 8px;
}

.buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 15px;
    margin-top: 25px;
}

button {
    padding: 16px;
    width: 100%;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 30px;
    background: #829477;
    color: white;
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

button:hover {
    background: #617657;
    transform: translateY(-3px);
}

button:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid #465B40;
    outline-offset: 4px;
}

.section {
    display: none;
    background: #FFFDF7;
    margin-top: 25px;
    padding: 25px 18px;
    border-radius: 22px;
    animation: fade 0.5s ease;
}

.section.active {
    display: block;
}

@keyframes fade {
    from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(15px);
    }
    to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
    }
}

h2 {
    font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
    color: #718468;
    font-size: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.letter {
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 2;
    color: #596653;
    white-space: pre-line;
}

.gallery {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 20px;
}

.gallery img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 180px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 15px;
    border: 4px solid #E5EADD;
}

.back {
    background: #DDE4D5;
    color: #586B50;
    margin-top: 22px;
}

.back:hover {
    background: #C8D4BF;
}

footer {
    color: #F8F6ED;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    margin: 30px 0;
}

.heart {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: -30px;
    pointer-events: none;
    animation: float 7s linear forwards;
    z-index: 5;
}

@keyframes float {
    0% {
        transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg);
        opacity: 0;
    }
    20% {
        opacity: 0.8;
    }
    100% {
        transform: translateY(-110vh) rotate(360deg);
        opacity: 0;
    }
}
</style></head><body><div class="container"><div class="card"><p class="top">A LITTLE SURPRISE FOR YOU</p>

<div class="flower">🌷</div>

<h1>Happy 19th<br>Birthday!</h1>

<p class="subtitle">
    To someone who makes life a little more beautiful.<br>
    Today, the world celebrates YOU. ♡
</p>

<div class="divider">♡ ✿ ♡</div>

<p style="font-size:13px;color:#84927B;">
    I prepared something special for you...
</p>

<div class="buttons">

    <button onclick="openSection('letter')">
        💌 OPEN YOUR LETTER
    </button>

    <button onclick="openSection('pictures')">
        📸 OUR LITTLE MEMORIES
    </button>

    <button onclick="openSection('surprise')">
        🎀 ONE LAST SURPRISE
    </button>

</div>

<!-- BIRTHDAY LETTER -->

<div class="section" id="letter">

    <h2>A Letter For You ♡</h2>

    <div class="divider">✿ ♡ ✿</div>

    <div class="letter" id="message">

Dear Birthday Girl,

HAPPIEST 19TH BIRTHDAY!!

First of all, I just want to say how grateful I am to have you in my life. You deserve all the happiness, love, and beautiful things this world has to offer.

As you enter another chapter of your life, I hope you never forget how special you are. I hope you continue to grow, chase your dreams, discover new things, and become the person you've always wanted to be.

 God bless you in all aspects of your life, may he comfort your worry heart rn, always count on Him, He will never disappoint you in His plans, if you ask why you were in that situation just remember that He has a plan on it.  Trust Him with all your hearts and continue serving Him.

Thank you for being YOU.

I hope you know that you are appreciated more than words can explain. No matter where life takes us, I hope we continue making beautiful memories together.

Enjoy your day, birthday girl! You deserve everything beautiful in this world.

I LOVE YOU! ♡

With lots of love,
Your chellax 🫰💔 🌷
</div>

    <button class="back" onclick="closeSections()">
        ← GO BACK
    </button>

</div>

<!-- PHOTO GALLERY -->

<div class="section" id="pictures">

    <h2>Our Little Memories 📸</h2>

    <p class="subtitle">
        Every picture holds a little piece of happiness.
    </p>

    <div class="gallery">

        <!-- REPLACE THESE WITH YOUR <PHOTOS></PHOTOS> -->

        <img src="/IMG_20260911_170603_375.jpg"=alt="Our memory 1">
        <img src="/IMG_20260920_073614_570.jpg" alt="Our memory 2">
        <img src="/IMG_20261018_190059_555.png" alt="Our memory 3">
        <img src="/Messenger_creation_9EA30596-5370-4596-8ADA-D10487CE28D4.jpeg" alt="Our memory 4">
        <img src="/Messenger_creation_608B32BA-8A3F-447E-9B82-5A7602B44010.jpeg" alt="Our memory 5">
        <img src="/IMG_20260926_131932.jpg" alt="Our memory 6">

    </div>

    <button class="back" onclick="closeSections()">
        ← GO BACK
    </button>

</div>

<!-- EXTRA SURPRISE -->

<div class="section" id="surprise">

    <h2>A Little Reminder ♡</h2>

    <div style="font-size:55px;margin:20px;">🧸</div>

    <p class="letter" style="text-align:center;">
        You are growing, glowing, and becoming someone even more amazing.

        Never rush your journey. Enjoy being 19. Make mistakes, laugh loudly, take pictures, fall in love with life, and collect memories.

        You only turn 19 once, so make it count!

        <br><br>
        Always remember:

        <br><br>
        YOU ARE LOVED.<br>
        YOU ARE ENOUGH.<br>
        YOU ARE SPECIAL.

        <br><br>
        Happy birthday, girl! 🤍
    </p>

    <button class="back" onclick="closeSections()">
        ← GO BACK
    </button>

</div>

</div><footer>
    MADE WITH LOVE ♡ JUST FOR YOU
    <br><br>
    YOUR SPECIAL DAY 11/09/2026 🌿
</footer></div><script>

// OPEN BUTTON SECTIONS

function openSection(id) {

    closeSections();

    document.getElementById(id).classList.add('active');

    document.getElementById(id).scrollIntoView({
        behavior: 'smooth',
        block: 'nearest'
    });

}

// CLOSE SECTIONS

function closeSections() {

    document.querySelectorAll('.section').forEach(section => {
        section.classList.remove('active');
    });

}

// FLOATING DECORATIONS

const decorations = ['♡', '✿', '🌿', '🤍', '✨'];

function createDecoration() {

    const item = document.createElement('div');

    item.className = 'heart';

    item.innerHTML = decorations[
        Math.floor(Math.random() * decorations.length)
    ];

    item.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + 'vw';
    item.style.fontSize = (14 + Math.random() * 15) + 'px';
    item.style.animationDuration = (5 + Math.random() * 5) + 's';

    document.body.appendChild(item);

    setTimeout(() => {
        item.remove();
    }, 10000);

}

setInterval(createDecoration, 900);

</script></body>
</html>
